  build(termux): force qsort_r/memfd_create fallbacks on Android (device
    lacks API30+/API36+ libc symbols)
  build(termux): restrict panvk to JM archs (6,7) with kbase-only; CSF
    needs panthor
  build(termux): limit panvk entrypoint device-prefixes to built archs
  build(termux): compile panthor kmod helpers for kbase-only panvk CSF
    references
  kbase: bring the JM backend up on a uAPI 11.16 kernel (Kirin 990)
  panvk: Android-only Winlator/DXVK support for kbase 11.16 (G76)
  panvk: report valid update-after-bind limits on forced Bifrost profile
  panvk: run kbase JM submissions on the runtime thread

PanVK kbase (1):
  panvk: copy sync payloads in CPU on kbase

PanVK kbase bring-up (1):
  panvk: request linear swapchain buffers on Huawei gralloc

panvk (2):
  panvk/jm: add CPU-side diagnostic counters
  panvk/jm: report diagnostic window totals

panvk-luke (4):
  panvk/jm: submit kbase atoms asynchronously with dependencies
  panvk/jm: batch tiler+fragment atoms into one ioctl
  panvk: add diagnostic no-wait present path
  panvk: expose ROAA on Bifrost for ARMSX2 in-tile self-reads

